WEBVTT

00:00:09.030 --> 00:00:10.580
I screwed up again!

00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:13.330
I just can't get this rhythm here right!

00:00:16.090 --> 00:00:19.370
I lo~ve noodles! Or something like that...

00:00:19.370 --> 00:00:22.830
Oh, that's right! Is it summer 
vacation in the Human World?

00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:26.710
That son of mine... Send him 
some summer homework, would ya?

00:00:26.710 --> 00:00:29.130
Um, homework?

00:00:29.130 --> 00:00:32.280
Yeah! I mean, summer vacation 
always comes with homework, right?

00:00:32.280 --> 00:00:35.130
One of those, full-set thingamajigs... 
Anyway, make it so!

00:00:43.310 --> 00:00:44.890
And there you have it.

00:00:49.480 --> 00:00:51.890
And there you have <i>what</i>, exactly?

00:00:51.890 --> 00:00:53.400
What the hell?

00:00:53.740 --> 00:00:55.610
Summer vacation homework.

00:00:55.610 --> 00:00:57.490
He's an infant!

00:00:57.490 --> 00:00:59.120
Infants don't have homework!

00:00:59.120 --> 00:01:02.090
You should be thankful for this 
homework sent by the Great Demon Lord.

00:01:02.310 --> 00:01:07.130
Most gutter trash would never 
set eyes on a bounty like this.

00:01:07.130 --> 00:01:08.400
Get down and kneel before it.

00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:10.430
Shut up! Send it back this instant!

00:01:10.430 --> 00:01:12.890
Call Alaindelon and stuff it in his stomach!

00:01:12.890 --> 00:01:15.920
What am I to do with you? 
You are such a vulgar boor.

00:01:16.190 --> 00:01:19.680
You want me to pin you up as 
a summer vacation sample, eh?

00:01:19.680 --> 00:01:20.790
It's too late.

00:01:21.980 --> 00:01:24.080
The master has unsealed the wrapping.

00:01:26.930 --> 00:01:28.840
Wait a sec, Baby Beel!

00:01:30.310 --> 00:01:33.030
See, I told you. It's already too late.

00:01:35.530 --> 00:01:39.280
Yes... When opened, the 
wrapping naturally disappears.

00:01:39.640 --> 00:01:40.450
Environmentally friendly.

00:01:40.450 --> 00:01:41.830
There's way too much packaging!

00:01:42.760 --> 00:01:44.700
This is a Demon picture diary!

00:01:44.700 --> 00:01:46.620
A Demon morning-glory planting kit...

00:01:46.620 --> 00:01:49.080
And a Demon gathering kit, too.

00:01:49.080 --> 00:01:52.850
As expected from the Great Demon Lord... 
He thinks so much of the master!

00:01:52.850 --> 00:01:56.990
Um, no, Hilda-san. I have not the tiniest, 
slightest intention of accepting this.

00:01:56.990 --> 00:01:59.050
So might you send it back without delay?

00:01:59.050 --> 00:02:00.580
What are you spouting?

00:02:00.580 --> 00:02:03.610
Look at how the master's name is written...

00:02:02.600 --> 00:02:04.100
<b>Kaiser de Emperana Beelzebub IV</b>

00:02:05.230 --> 00:02:07.390
Haven't seen the full name in a while...

00:02:07.640 --> 00:02:10.690
Anyway, it doesn't matter if his 
name or whatever is written on it!

00:02:11.060 --> 00:02:11.860
Call Alaindelon...

00:02:13.260 --> 00:02:14.120
That was fast!

00:02:14.120 --> 00:02:19.180
Oga-dono... As you requested great 
haste, I have used a smidgen of force.

00:02:19.180 --> 00:02:21.910
I have brought Furuichi-dono with me!

00:02:21.910 --> 00:02:23.450
I didn't call for Furuichi!

00:02:23.450 --> 00:02:26.250
He didn't even call me!

00:02:26.740 --> 00:02:28.620
My epic highlands tale!

00:02:29.350 --> 00:02:33.530
Thanks to <i>someone</i>, my epic beach 
tale was ruined, remember?

00:02:33.530 --> 00:02:37.880
So I thought, "this time!" and went 
to the highlands with my family!

00:02:37.880 --> 00:02:40.710
And yet... This!

00:02:40.710 --> 00:02:41.780
Yay.

00:02:45.420 --> 00:02:47.230
Where did you come from?

00:02:48.510 --> 00:02:51.020
Call Alaindelon and stuff it in his stomach!

00:02:51.020 --> 00:02:51.730
In that case...

00:02:54.400 --> 00:02:56.110
Take responsibility!

00:02:56.110 --> 00:02:58.200
Take it, okay?

00:03:04.070 --> 00:03:05.840
Cut it out!

00:03:08.080 --> 00:03:09.750
Once upon a time, in a land far far away...

00:03:09.750 --> 00:03:13.090
there was a barbaric, ruthless, defiant,

00:03:13.090 --> 00:03:17.020
demon-like bastard who thought 
nothing of his fellow man.

00:03:17.020 --> 00:03:17.960
Hey!

00:04:58.020 --> 00:05:02.940
<b>How About Some Demon World Homework?</b>

00:05:03.550 --> 00:05:04.890
So heavy!

00:05:04.890 --> 00:05:08.160
I can't handle it! Oga-dono, I give in!

00:05:08.160 --> 00:05:10.160
I said I can't take it!

00:05:10.160 --> 00:05:13.630
Unless you write... Unless you 
write who it's addressed to...

00:05:13.630 --> 00:05:16.540
Send it to that Great Demon Lord 
in the Demon World, you bastard!

00:05:16.540 --> 00:05:18.450
You're pushing it too far!

00:05:18.450 --> 00:05:22.640
But... I like how you 
can get rough with me...

00:05:25.810 --> 00:05:26.930
Shut up!

00:05:27.430 --> 00:05:29.010
Enough of this.

00:05:29.010 --> 00:05:32.690
You think I'm just gonna 
let this be dumped on me?

00:05:32.690 --> 00:05:36.980
I do not think you comprehend 
what "homework" really is.

00:05:36.980 --> 00:05:41.400
Not to brag, but I have never done 
homework once in my entire life!

00:05:41.400 --> 00:05:42.900
It's not something to brag about.

00:05:42.900 --> 00:05:45.370
Listen carefully. This is 
what Demon World homework is:

00:05:45.370 --> 00:05:47.190
Work that will challenge your very limits,

00:05:47.190 --> 00:05:50.130
and squeeze out every last drop of your life!

00:05:50.130 --> 00:05:52.800
With homework, it's eat or be eaten!

00:05:52.800 --> 00:05:54.910
Survival of the fittest to the very end!

00:05:55.810 --> 00:06:00.630
Once your name is written, 
there is no longer any escape.

00:06:01.190 --> 00:06:03.880
You have no choice but to 
try and get through it!

00:06:04.360 --> 00:06:05.630
And if you do not...

00:06:06.380 --> 00:06:10.570
Hey hey, Oga... Our Hilda-san 
is acting really scared!

00:06:10.570 --> 00:06:12.390
This is way too dangerous!

00:06:12.390 --> 00:06:16.380
Not to mention this is homework handed down 
directly from the Great Demon Lord himself!

00:06:16.380 --> 00:06:18.920
If, by some chance he were dissatisfied,

00:06:19.150 --> 00:06:21.360
his anger would be truly great!

00:06:21.360 --> 00:06:23.770
He would this... And he would that...!

00:06:23.770 --> 00:06:25.400
I'm mad!

00:06:26.650 --> 00:06:29.350
We have to complete the 
homework no matter what!

00:06:29.350 --> 00:06:32.230
We have to obtain the Great 
Demon Lord's words of praise!

00:06:32.230 --> 00:06:33.500
Understand, plebeians?

00:06:33.500 --> 00:06:37.660
You will squeeze your meager knowledge out of 
your heads and help the master with his homework!

00:06:38.400 --> 00:06:41.040
She's great at demotivation...

00:06:41.380 --> 00:06:43.920
If I meet this Great Demon 
Lord, I will so punch him.

00:06:45.020 --> 00:06:46.690
OMG Notebook?

00:06:46.920 --> 00:06:50.450
Each page of the notebook must be filled 
with a drawing or letters as you see fit.

00:06:50.450 --> 00:06:53.880
It's popular homework lately that 
reflects the lack of preparation

00:06:53.880 --> 00:06:55.780
and creativity of the homework giver.

00:06:56.020 --> 00:06:57.560
Wonderful!

00:06:57.560 --> 00:06:58.770
Hilda-san...

00:06:58.770 --> 00:07:02.400
So basically we just need to 
write something on each page?

00:07:02.400 --> 00:07:03.940
Then that's a cinch.

00:07:03.940 --> 00:07:07.100
Okay, Baby Beel! Write whatever you like!

00:07:24.470 --> 00:07:26.230
W-What's this?

00:07:26.230 --> 00:07:28.880
It's... a cat!

00:07:28.880 --> 00:07:32.390
My, what a cute cat! Impressive, Master!

00:07:32.390 --> 00:07:33.470
You are so good at drawing!

00:07:33.470 --> 00:07:35.890
You lie! How exactly is that a cat?

00:07:35.890 --> 00:07:37.740
It's a cat! Yes, master?

00:07:39.850 --> 00:07:43.340
Master said it is a cat, so it is a cat!

00:07:43.750 --> 00:07:46.610
Right-right... A cat, of course.

00:07:48.660 --> 00:07:50.900
Get it off! I said get it off!

00:07:51.250 --> 00:07:52.610
Furuichi-dono?

00:07:55.340 --> 00:08:00.230
I see. It seems like anything drawn 
in this notebook gains actual form.

00:08:00.230 --> 00:08:02.180
It is indeed an OMG Notebook!

00:08:02.180 --> 00:08:05.870
Something thrilling and new! For example...

00:08:10.930 --> 00:08:13.230
Here, master! It's milk!

00:08:19.580 --> 00:08:21.810
It seems drawing the taste is beyond me.

00:08:21.810 --> 00:08:23.940
Let me try! Like this....

00:08:23.940 --> 00:08:27.440
Hot guy ("ike-men"), come out, come out!

00:08:33.650 --> 00:08:35.940
"I" "Ke" "Me" and "N"...

00:08:39.820 --> 00:08:41.660
These are letters!

00:08:41.660 --> 00:08:43.790
Now, Baby Beel... Draw whatever you like!

00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:45.310
Me, me, me!

00:08:45.310 --> 00:08:49.210
Allow me to draw just 
one mere page, dear sir!

00:08:49.210 --> 00:08:51.170
You won't draw anything worth crap.

00:08:52.220 --> 00:08:56.540
And who was it that dragged me away from 
my lovely beach adventure last episode?

00:08:56.540 --> 00:09:01.180
And who was it that dragged me away from 
my lovely highlands adventure this episode?

00:09:01.180 --> 00:09:05.190
Can't you at least let 
me use one little page?

00:09:09.570 --> 00:09:10.980
The absolute worst.

00:09:11.520 --> 00:09:12.600
The worst.

00:09:14.540 --> 00:09:16.530
You are truly horrible, yes...

00:09:16.790 --> 00:09:18.360
You're no better!

00:09:18.360 --> 00:09:19.530
Why?

00:09:21.460 --> 00:09:24.990
A collection kit... Will something 
like whatever that is, count?

00:09:26.020 --> 00:09:26.950
It's a cat!

00:09:26.950 --> 00:09:29.460
Oh yeah, right. A cute kitty cat.

00:09:29.460 --> 00:09:31.890
For your information, cats in the Demon World

00:09:31.890 --> 00:09:36.470
are 8 meters tall and destroy an 
entire village before breakfast.

00:09:36.470 --> 00:09:41.520
The cat that the master drew unfortunately 
lacks power in comparison.

00:09:42.020 --> 00:09:45.430
This surely won't impress 
the Great Demon Lord.

00:09:46.140 --> 00:09:51.540
We must collect larger, stronger, 
and rarer prey of greater variety!

00:09:51.940 --> 00:09:55.150
That creature is surely not enough to be 
recognized as sufficient for the master,

00:09:55.150 --> 00:09:56.780
heir to the Demon World.

00:09:56.780 --> 00:10:00.100
Well, sure, but this is the Human World.

00:10:00.100 --> 00:10:03.480
Is there a place with things 
like that? I mean...

00:10:03.480 --> 00:10:04.780
Large...

00:10:04.780 --> 00:10:05.740
Strong...

00:10:05.740 --> 00:10:07.030
Rare...

00:10:07.030 --> 00:10:08.540
And plenty of variety...

00:10:09.660 --> 00:10:11.540
We have that place, do we not?

00:10:11.540 --> 00:10:12.450
That place?

00:10:12.450 --> 00:10:13.040
That place?

00:10:34.140 --> 00:10:35.630
What the heck is that?

00:10:36.490 --> 00:10:38.900
It's that cat-like creature.

00:10:38.900 --> 00:10:41.800
It seems to have taken a 
liking to the big guy's head.

00:10:43.490 --> 00:10:45.660
Why is it coming with us?

00:10:45.660 --> 00:10:50.430
What else can I do? If my sister 
sees it at home, then...

00:10:50.430 --> 00:10:52.500
Your sister? She'll be fine.

00:10:53.040 --> 00:10:55.360
That's why I'm scared!

00:10:55.360 --> 00:10:57.510
If she asks to keep it as a pet, then...

00:11:00.400 --> 00:11:02.390
Yeah, that might be a problem.

00:11:03.890 --> 00:11:06.640
We're here. This is the hunting grounds.

00:11:09.890 --> 00:11:11.600
Hey, hey, hey!

00:11:11.600 --> 00:11:15.700
Why do I have to go to school 
during summer vacation?

00:11:15.700 --> 00:11:18.400
If you need a place that has a great variety

00:11:18.400 --> 00:11:22.310
of large, strong, and rare 
things, this is the only spot.

00:11:22.310 --> 00:11:25.990
Why the hell are you coming to 
school during summer break, huh?

00:11:25.990 --> 00:11:28.370
And so, why are <i>you</i> here?

00:11:28.370 --> 00:11:31.240
Because I was lonely at home, duh!

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:34.880
And maybe I missed you a little, huh?

00:11:34.880 --> 00:11:36.450
That makes sense.

00:11:36.450 --> 00:11:37.880
Don't swallow that explanation!

00:11:41.350 --> 00:11:43.160
Now, capture them!

00:11:43.160 --> 00:11:44.680
Capture them?

00:11:44.680 --> 00:11:47.620
The wrath of the Great Demon 
Lord is a fearsome thing indeed!

00:11:47.620 --> 00:11:50.020
I'm afraid to even put it into words!

00:11:50.020 --> 00:11:51.340
I can barely imagine it!

00:11:51.340 --> 00:11:52.980
He would this... And he would that...!

00:11:52.980 --> 00:11:54.690
I know already, sheesh!

00:12:01.670 --> 00:12:03.280
Master, over here.

00:12:11.160 --> 00:12:12.530
It's pretty simple, actually.

00:12:12.530 --> 00:12:14.150
Can we... do this?

00:12:14.150 --> 00:12:16.060
Now, on to the next!

00:12:16.750 --> 00:12:18.500
Good Ni...ce shot.

00:12:20.560 --> 00:12:22.170
Hey, did you hear?

00:12:22.210 --> 00:12:24.760
The rampaging Ogre's started hunting humans!

00:12:30.150 --> 00:12:32.030
If he finds you, you're in trouble!

00:12:36.360 --> 00:12:39.000
Oh, we've collected quite a few.

00:12:39.000 --> 00:12:43.980
But they're kind of, plain. We need 
like a rare one like a "horned beetle".

00:12:46.620 --> 00:12:48.600
Baby Beel, wait here a bit.

00:12:48.600 --> 00:12:50.400
I'm gonna go find us a real flashy...

00:12:55.820 --> 00:12:58.050
Hey, hey, hey, Oga!

00:12:58.050 --> 00:13:00.460
You're sure doing whatever the 
hell you want, aren't you?

00:13:00.460 --> 00:13:05.180
Coming to school during summer break? 
You sure have a lot of free time.

00:13:08.150 --> 00:13:10.020
A cicada and a pillbug?

00:13:10.450 --> 00:13:11.930
Needs a little more.

00:13:12.460 --> 00:13:14.480
Don't you think this is plenty?

00:13:14.880 --> 00:13:19.550
If you will pardon the interruption, 
Oga-dono, in my opinion,

00:13:19.550 --> 00:13:22.860
a butterfly will truly 
complete the collection.

00:13:22.860 --> 00:13:23.940
Butterfly?

00:13:23.940 --> 00:13:26.950
Yes. For example, like that.

00:13:30.910 --> 00:13:35.710
That is indeed the butterfly which flutters 
through the halls of Ishiyama... Queen Kunieda!

00:13:35.980 --> 00:13:37.580
Ah, well. Guess I have to.

00:13:38.500 --> 00:13:39.560
Hey.

00:13:40.890 --> 00:13:41.820
Oga?

00:13:41.820 --> 00:13:44.930
Sorry, but can I catch you for a bit?

00:13:44.930 --> 00:13:46.870
What? C-Catch me?

00:13:46.870 --> 00:13:49.720
Catch me? How?

00:13:50.720 --> 00:13:52.080
Like, capture me?

00:13:52.080 --> 00:13:54.160
Rope? Trap?

00:13:54.400 --> 00:13:55.830
A love trap?!

00:13:55.830 --> 00:13:57.650
Like, fall in love?!

00:13:57.980 --> 00:13:59.250
Wait a...

00:13:59.250 --> 00:14:02.590
I'm not ready for... love...

00:14:02.590 --> 00:14:03.940
I just can't!

00:14:04.220 --> 00:14:05.030
Hey!

00:14:10.490 --> 00:14:12.930
Why? Why am I running?

00:14:12.930 --> 00:14:15.040
My heart screams out to run 
in the opposite direction!

00:14:25.720 --> 00:14:27.700
She's not so easy to catch.

00:14:30.440 --> 00:14:34.850
Oga-dono, how about slathering 
honey on this pillar here?

00:14:34.850 --> 00:14:38.850
Yes. And we should mix in 
numbing drug with the honey.

00:14:38.850 --> 00:14:40.250
Oh, that's it!

00:14:40.250 --> 00:14:41.830
Don't approve of that!

00:14:43.720 --> 00:14:45.480
W-What's this?

00:14:54.350 --> 00:14:55.420
Master?

00:14:55.420 --> 00:14:58.050
Are those the Demon morning-glory seeds?

00:14:59.370 --> 00:15:02.070
With two leaves and a high growth rate,

00:15:02.070 --> 00:15:04.390
they are definitely from those seeds, yes.

00:15:04.750 --> 00:15:05.970
What is it?

00:15:07.380 --> 00:15:10.880
Master, when did you do that?

00:15:15.450 --> 00:15:16.720
Here we go!

00:15:23.520 --> 00:15:25.330
Demon morning-glory?

00:15:25.800 --> 00:15:28.030
It sounds dangerous just from the name!

00:15:28.030 --> 00:15:30.850
Oh, it's perfectly fine.

00:15:30.850 --> 00:15:34.330
A Demon morning-glory by itself 
is nothing to worry about.

00:15:34.330 --> 00:15:36.540
Yes. Demon morning-glory's 
distinguishing feature is...

00:15:39.800 --> 00:15:41.380
...the fact that they're carnivorous.

00:15:46.050 --> 00:15:48.140
I think that's plenty a big problem.

00:15:48.140 --> 00:15:52.270
Really? As long as you feed them 
enough, they are quite well behaved.

00:15:52.270 --> 00:15:56.010
Yes. Had I not seen a Demon noon-glory,

00:15:56.010 --> 00:15:59.250
I would have thought Demon-World plants 
were much like Human World plants.

00:16:01.060 --> 00:16:04.260
Um, I'm not asking because 
I care in particular,

00:16:04.260 --> 00:16:06.680
but what's a Demon noon-glory?

00:16:06.680 --> 00:16:08.070
That is a good question.

00:16:08.550 --> 00:16:10.740
When you compare it to 
the Demon morning-glory,

00:16:10.740 --> 00:16:12.650
the noon-glory is somewhat smaller.

00:16:12.650 --> 00:16:16.190
But it is faster and more 
violent to compensate.

00:16:16.620 --> 00:16:19.080
The flower's color is usually light pink,

00:16:19.080 --> 00:16:21.350
and as they eat people, they 
get deeper and deeper red.

00:16:22.100 --> 00:16:28.430
Sometimes the seeds can accidentally get 
switched for the Demon morning-glory kits.

00:16:28.690 --> 00:16:31.590
But if they are only noon-glory 
seeds, there shouldn't be a problem.

00:16:31.590 --> 00:16:36.750
Oh, I see... Then, that's probably 
it, right? A Demon noon-glory...

00:16:36.750 --> 00:16:37.850
What?

00:16:37.850 --> 00:16:38.600
It can't be!

00:16:46.120 --> 00:16:48.070
It ate the Principal!

00:16:48.070 --> 00:16:49.980
No! Our Principal!

00:16:49.980 --> 00:16:51.240
Let's get revenge!

00:16:56.310 --> 00:16:58.240
What a beautiful color!

00:16:58.240 --> 00:17:04.340
Um, you said that the morning-glories were 
fine just as long as we didn't get a noon one...

00:17:04.340 --> 00:17:06.160
What happens when they're mixed together?

00:17:06.940 --> 00:17:10.280
When a Demon morning-glory and a Demon 
noon-glory pollinate each other...

00:17:12.890 --> 00:17:14.260
It grows into a giant.

00:17:21.810 --> 00:17:23.520
And it can walk.

00:17:25.900 --> 00:17:30.020
As expected from cross-breeding... Nothing 
can likely stop it here in the Human World.

00:17:30.020 --> 00:17:32.340
Hey, hey, hey! What should we do?

00:17:33.500 --> 00:17:35.400
It's capturing everyone!

00:17:40.500 --> 00:17:43.910
It probably will carry them to its 
roost where it can slowly savor...

00:17:45.370 --> 00:17:47.000
<b>Delinquents vs "Morning and Noon"-Glory!</b>

00:17:46.850 --> 00:17:49.000
What kind of program <i>is</i> that?

00:17:49.860 --> 00:17:52.410
Burying Punch!

00:17:53.510 --> 00:17:54.970
Kick!

00:18:00.780 --> 00:18:02.780
Damn... It's no use.

00:18:02.780 --> 00:18:05.810
Hey, isn't there some way 
to calm down this flower?

00:18:05.810 --> 00:18:06.950
True...

00:18:07.900 --> 00:18:12.080
There was some kind of support pole 
in the Demon morning-glory set...

00:18:16.550 --> 00:18:17.820
Pole, pole...

00:18:17.820 --> 00:18:19.910
This? No, that's not it...

00:18:22.100 --> 00:18:24.250
Hey, what's going on here?

00:18:24.250 --> 00:18:26.550
Is this your doing, Oga?

00:18:26.550 --> 00:18:28.330
This ain't cool at all, man!

00:18:28.330 --> 00:18:31.240
Shut up and help search!

00:18:31.240 --> 00:18:33.730
I'm looking for a stick, or something.

00:18:33.730 --> 00:18:35.440
A stick?

00:18:35.440 --> 00:18:37.300
Uh, how about this?

00:18:37.300 --> 00:18:39.060
That's a Demon fly-swatter.

00:18:39.060 --> 00:18:40.970
It can also swat things other than flies.

00:18:42.700 --> 00:18:43.720
Me?

00:18:44.150 --> 00:18:45.360
Sorry about that.

00:18:47.270 --> 00:18:50.140
Why am I doing this for that bastard Oga?

00:18:50.810 --> 00:18:52.210
Is this it?

00:18:52.550 --> 00:18:55.360
Close. That's a Demon Tasty Stick.

00:18:55.360 --> 00:18:57.260
Tasty Stick?

00:18:57.590 --> 00:19:00.490
It'll force you to eat it 
until you say, "Tasty".

00:19:06.740 --> 00:19:08.850
Give me a break here!

00:19:09.720 --> 00:19:11.290
This, right?

00:19:11.290 --> 00:19:15.500
There's one of those? Unfortunately, 
no. That is a Demon yam.

00:19:15.500 --> 00:19:16.530
Yam?

00:19:16.860 --> 00:19:18.510
You mean like the vegetable?

00:19:18.510 --> 00:19:22.010
Yes. But Demon yams... are carnivorous.

00:19:24.720 --> 00:19:27.250
Screw this!

00:19:27.250 --> 00:19:29.020
Are you sure it's even in here?

00:19:29.020 --> 00:19:31.230
Look carefully. It should be here.

00:19:35.440 --> 00:19:36.350
You!

00:19:37.150 --> 00:19:38.650
<b>Leave this to me!</b>

00:19:38.900 --> 00:19:40.650
<b>I cannot forget the debt I owe</b>

00:19:40.650 --> 00:19:41.910
<b>for being given life in this world!</b>

00:19:43.780 --> 00:19:45.160
<b>I will show you a little</b>

00:19:45.160 --> 00:19:46.910
<b>of my pride!</b>

00:20:03.590 --> 00:20:08.100
<b>I shall never forgive the likes of you.</b>

00:20:08.430 --> 00:20:11.920
Master, what a truly regal presence!

00:20:11.920 --> 00:20:14.190
You are indeed the heir 
of the Great Demon Lord!

00:20:17.110 --> 00:20:18.110
<b>I shall never forgive the likes of you.</b>

00:20:22.580 --> 00:20:26.750
Don't cry, don't cry! Baby Beel, real 
men don't cry 'cause of a little pain!

00:20:26.750 --> 00:20:29.750
Show it the pride of the heir 
of the Great Demon Lord!

00:20:40.050 --> 00:20:43.220
Monja Anger Punch!

00:20:54.120 --> 00:20:58.090
What? Why was I sleeping here?

00:20:58.090 --> 00:21:01.650
What the hell are you 
doing napping next to me?

00:21:01.650 --> 00:21:04.150
Why am I here?

00:21:04.150 --> 00:21:06.990
What was with that giant morning-glory?

00:21:06.990 --> 00:21:10.630
They said something about 
a... Macao morning-glory?

00:21:10.630 --> 00:21:13.910
Macao must be pretty crazy if its 
morning-glories are that big.

00:21:14.450 --> 00:21:18.100
I'm totally gonna wallop 
that Great Demon Lord...

00:21:20.570 --> 00:21:22.140
Hey, Oga!

00:21:30.680 --> 00:21:33.350
I know the song in my head, damn it!

00:21:33.350 --> 00:21:35.290
Pardon the interruption, Great Demon Lord,

00:21:35.290 --> 00:21:39.360
but your son in the Human World 
has sent back his homework.

00:21:39.360 --> 00:21:42.120
Huh? What's this? Homework?

00:21:42.120 --> 00:21:44.130
Oh, did I send him that?

00:21:44.130 --> 00:21:46.310
I did? Oh.

00:21:46.310 --> 00:21:48.820
Then give him one of those "Prize for 
Best Effort" things, or whatever.

00:21:49.400 --> 00:21:50.490
Right...

00:21:59.540 --> 00:22:01.900
Why is this the only realistic part?

00:22:01.900 --> 00:22:05.050
Here you go, Master! Good for you!

00:23:42.070 --> 00:23:44.720
A-A night-glory!

00:24:04.320 --> 00:24:06.450
The master is acting strange.

00:24:06.450 --> 00:24:08.320
He's just got a summer cold, is all.

00:24:08.320 --> 00:24:10.130
No, I think this is serious.

00:24:10.130 --> 00:24:12.690
Look. The Zebul Spell is disappearing.

00:24:12.690 --> 00:24:15.140
That's proof that the link between 
you and the master is vanishing.

00:24:15.400 --> 00:24:19.140
Seriously? Then does that mean 
I'm finally free of Baby Beel?

00:24:21.640 --> 00:24:25.650
On the next Beelzebub: I've 
Quit Being the BoB Brawler!

00:24:25.650 --> 00:24:28.150
Are you really okay with that?
